following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-01-26T23:18:02Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3804075056","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2804#issuecomment-3804075056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2804","id":3804075056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887ivZQw","user":{"login":"oneingan","id":810075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDA3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan","html_url":"https://github.com/oneingan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T09:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T09:25:52Z","body":"You might want to look at Biscuit as a good fit for the “external controller / approval UX” part of this discussion.\r\n\r\nBiscuit is an authorization token format designed for capability-style workflows (delegation/attenuation, expiry, policy constraints), with decentralized verification and offline attenuation. That seems aligned with the idea of issuing something from the admin API that a controller can refine and hand off, without needing to expose the registration cache as a stable API surface.\r\n\r\nLink: https://www.biscuitsec.org/\r\n\r\nIf that direction makes sense, a possible headscale-native approach could be: issue an API-created token (auth key or similar) and let the external orchestrator attenuate it (scope/expiry/constraints) to drive a friendly “approve/join” flow, rather than listing pending registrations directly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3804075056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"oneingan","id":810075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDA3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan","html_url":"https://github.com/oneingan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oneingan/eve